Steps To setup and run the project : 


Step 1. Open microservice tutorial in eclipse
Step 2. Go to pgAdmin4 (Postgres Database) and run the quesries for creating question database and quiz database
Step 3. Go to pgAdmin4 in respective databases and run the queries for tables (already uploaded in github) in respective databases.
Step 4. Go to Postman and hit the URL's according to controller and request involved.


Happy and set.
